<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Gamo project</book>
  <para style="h">Gelatiyan</para>
  <para style="mt1">Gelatiyan</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Assi xeygidaden asi Kiitidade gidonta Yesuss Kiristossa hayqope denthida iza aawa Xoossafe kiititda Phawulossape. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tanagara diza ishata wurisofe Gelatiyan diza wossa keethatas. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nu aawa Xoossafe Goda Yesuss Kiristossa Xoossa kiyatethine saroy intes gido. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nu aawa Xoossa shenemala hayssa ita 7alamezape nuna ashanas nena aththi imidaysas. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Xoossas medhiipe medhiina gakanas izas bonchoy gido.</para>
  <para style="s">Mishiracho qaalay mexxi isino.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Inte intena Kiristossa kiiyatethan xeygidaysa agagidi hara duma shako mishiracho qaalakko siimidaysi tana daro garanthes (malalises) <verse number="7" style="v"/>Tumape qasse isinipe hara mishiracho qaalay dena. Coo intena balethanasne Kiristossa mishiracho qaala miirqanas koyza is asati detes. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Gido attiin nuna gidin woykko sallo kiitanchata gidinka nu intes sabkiida mishiracho qaalape hara duma mishiracho qaala sabakiko he uray medhiinaso qangetidade giido. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nu kase gidamalaka ta haikka zaridaka kasse inte eko mishiracho qaalape hara duma mishiracho qaala sabakiko izadey medhinas qangetidade gido gays. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Haii ta asi tana eroshi hashuganamala koyazina ye Xoosi hashu gaana mala koyazina? Woykko asa ufaysana koyazina? Ta ase ufaysana koyzako Kiristossa oothancha gidikke.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawulossa Xoossan xeygetides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ta ishato ta intes sabakiida mishirachoy asa ootho gidontaysa inte eranamala koyays. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ta asape ekabeykene asape tamara beyke. Yesuss Kiristossa tas qonccisides attiin. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Tani kasse Ayhudata amano wana diidakone Xoossa wossa keethe ta aymala godidakone qasse mule dhaysanas ta aymala dafetidakone inte siydista. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kase ta diza woden diza daro Ayhude asata darotape amanon adhays. Kasse nu awata waga naganas daro minays shin. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Gido attiin kasse koyro tana ta ayy ullon bes shakiida ba kiiyatethan ana xeygida Xoossi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Amanonta dereza gidon iza gish ta sabakanamala ba naza tanan qoncisana dosida gish ta asho mayda asara oonaraka zoristabeyke. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Tape kasse Haware gididaytako Yerusalame ba beyke shin amanida mala heraka arabe biita badis hepekka Damasqo simadis. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hepeka heezdzdu laythae guye Phixirossara gaganas Yerusalame kezadis. Izara gagada tamane ichachu galas gakanas gam7adiis. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Gidikokka Goda Gakanas gam7adis. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Haysa ta intes xafizaysan wogado hasa7ontaysa Xoossa sinthan yotays. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hessafe guye gede Soriyane Kilqiya getetiza dere badis. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kirstossa amaniza yodan diza wossa keethata asay tana bey eretena. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Gido attiin “Beni nuna amano gish godi dhaysana koyza adezi haii he amano zari sabakes” Giza wore xala siiyda. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Isti ta giidon Xoosu galatida.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Phawulossa hanko Hawaretii mokki ekida.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Tamane oydu laythafe guye qassekka Yerusalame keezadis. He wode Barnabasara days Titossaka tanara ekka badis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tas qoncida giish he badis. Amanonta dereza gidon ta sabakiiza mishiracho qaalaka istas yotadis. Shin ta kasse mella woxxiidakone gane qassekka sinthafe coo mela woxonta mala hirgada wanatizaytas duma erisadis. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Haray atosin tanara diza Titosay izi girike asa shin wolliqara iza qaxxara qaxaretibeyna. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Haysi ha yozi dendiday isi isi wordo amanizayti nuni Yesussa Kiristossan demida goqatetha yuuy yuuy pacci beyanasne nuna ayletethan gelithanas lodara nuko salli gellida gishasa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hayta ha asatasi nuni isitoka hafeti beyko. Hesikka inte wongile tumatethan eqi danamala gidiko. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Wana milatiza asati tas aykokka milatetena Xoossi asa ayfeso beydi mado ootherena. Heyti he asati ta kiitiza yotas tas ooykoka gujji beytena. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Gido attiin Phexirosay Ayhudatas mishiracho qaala sabakanas hadara ekiidaysa mala taka qaxaretontaytas mishiracho qaala sabakanas hardara ekidaysa istti erida. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Phixirosa Ayhudistas Haware gidi oothana mala oothida Xoossi taka amanonta deretas Haware gida oothana mala taas imides. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Wana tusamala gidida Phesxirosane Yansaykka tas imetida Xoossa imo akekidi tasne ista qasse Ayhudatas qasla yotanas qaala gagidos. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Isti nus hadara giday manqotas qofa nu agontamala gida. Tasikka hessa oothaysi amo.</para>
  <para style="s">Phawulossay Phixirosay gizaz ixxides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Phixirossa anxokiya yda wode erettida bale oothida gish ta iza qonccen izi gizaysa ixxadis (izara eqitadis) <verse number="12" style="v"/>Isi isi asati Yaqobe achafe yanape kase Phixirossay amanonta deretara isipe kaththa miizaysa asati ydape guye qaxaretida asatas babidi amanonta dere asape shaketida guye guye ooykides. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Barnabasayka istathoka qoshepe qomon hanon ekistana gakanas hara Ayhudatika iza hanon izara ispetida. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ista oothoy mishiracho qaala tuma gidontaysa ta erada kumetha asa achan Phixirosa “Ne Ayhuda asa shin amanonta dereta wogan attiin Ayhudista wogan daka histin amanonta dereti Ayhudata dereta wogga kalanamala aazas woliqathize? <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Nuni nu yeletethan Ayhudatape attiin nagarancha amanonta dereta gidoko. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Asi Yesuss Kirstossa amanon xiilana attiin Muse woga nagon xiilontaysa nu erosu. Hessa gish wogga nagon gidonta Kirstossa amanon nu xiilanamala nukka qasse Yesuss Kistossa amanidosu. Muse wogga nagon oonikka xellena. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nu Ayhudati wurikka Christosa baggara Xoossara giganas koyos. Nukka hankko asa mala nagaranchata gididaysa eros. Histin Kirstossay nagaray akii banamala koyize? Muleka koyena. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Tani lalida woga zara ta kushera keexxiza gidiko taka wogga moridade gididaysa amanistays. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Tani Xoossas danamala Muse wogga bagara he wogas hayqasdis. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Tani Kiristossara kaqitadis hayssafe guye dizay tana gidike shin Kiristossa ta gidon des. Haikka ta ashon diza dusay tana dosidi bena ta gish oothi imida Xoossa na bolla diza amanon days. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Tani Xoossa kiyateth kawushike. Xiilotethi Muse wogga nagon betiza misha gidiko Kirstossay mella hed hayqides gusaka?”</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Amanon woykko oorate wogga nago.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Inteno yushi qoponta Gelatiya asatoy! intes baletontamala iza kaqetetha ta inte sinthan milale mala gigisa besdisko shin intena oone biitiday? <verse number="2" style="v"/>Inte Xillo ayana ekiday Muse wogga nagone ye sabaketida qaala amanone? Ta hano isiniyo ta intefe erana koyays. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Inte hessamala qopi eronta asse? Ayanan oykidaysa zaridi ashon geyanas wayeteti? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Tumu inte hano gakanas daburida daburisay co mella? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Xoossi intes ayana imidayne inte achan malata oothiday inte Muse wogga nagida gisheye Woyko inte siiyda qalan amanida giishe? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ane inte Abirame gish qoppiite “Izi Xoosu amanin amamoy izas xiillotethan qodetides.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hesa gish amanizayti Abirame nayta gididaysa yushi qopiite (Wozinan wothiite) <verse number="8" style="v"/>Dere asay amanon atanaysa eridi Xoosu kasse maxxafan “Derey wuri ne bagara anjjistana” Giidi mishiracho qaala Abiirames erisides. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hesa gish amanizayti wurii amaniza Abiramera isipw anjjetidayta. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Muse wogga nagon amanetizayti wurikka qantha garisan detes. Muse wogga maxxafatan xafetidaysa wursi Othontadey zi qangetidade” geteti xafetides. <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Xiillo uray amanon deyos” giiza gish onikka Xoossa sinthan Muse woggan atontaysi gesha. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Muse woggan amanon xaphiibeyna. Gido attin “Muse wogata Musesi nagizadey he izi nagidaysan deyon dana getetides. <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Miitha bolla kaqetizadey he uray qangetidade” geteti xafetida gish Kiristossay nu gish qangetidade gididi nuna Muse wogga qangethafe wozinas. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Abirime imetida anjjoy Yesuss Kiristosa bagara deres gakanamala nuna wozides. Hesikka nuni amanon Xoossi immana gida iza ayana ufaysa ekanamala hanides.</para>
  <para style="s">Muse woggane sinthafes yotida qaala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ta ishato ane ta intes asi ba dusan hanizamisha Museso imays. Haray atoshin asi isito bazida qaala isito bazidappe guye oonikka sharanas woykko hara iza bolla gujjana danda7ontaysamala haysikka hessa malakko. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Xoossi Abirames yotida qaala Abiramesne iza zerethas. Maxxafay daro asas yotizamala “Iza zerethatas” Gena gido attiin isi asas yotetizamala “Ne zerethas” ges. Hesikka Kiristossa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ta gizaykka hayssako ooydu xistane heezdzdutamu laythafe guye imetida Muse wogay kasetidi Xoosi minthida caqqoza lalidi buro hanana ufaysa qaala sharena. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Biita latoy Muse wogan hanizako ufayasa qaala gelanas koshena gish Xoossi ba kiiyatethan qalan Abirames imetides. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hiistin Muse woggan azzas imetide? Muse wogay gudetiday asay woga yedhi athiza gish he ufaysay besiza zerethay yana gakanas Muse wogay ydayka kiitanchata bagara naga giiza isade bagara ydes. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Gidikkoka ganazi isa baga xala xelizade gidena. Xoossi gidiko izi isa xala. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Histin Muse wogay inthafe Xoosi wothina qaala digizaze? Cirasheka digena. Muse woga imetiday asi izan deyo demanas gididako tumuka xiilotethi bistanakoshin. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Qasse maxxafay haysi 7alamey wurikka nagaran qachetidaysa awajjes. Hesikka asi wurikka Yesuss Kiristossa amanon betiza ufaysay amanizaytas wurisos imistanasa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Haysi amanoy yanape kasse nuni Muse wogan qachetidi gordana dosu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hessa gish nu amanon xiilana mala Muse wogay nuna Kiristosakko gathanas nagizade mala gidi nagides. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ha7i qasse he amanoy yida gihs hayssafe guye nuni Muse wogga garisan dokko.</para>
  <para style="s">Xoossa nayta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Inte wurikka Yesuss Kiristossa amanon Xoossa nayta. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Inte Kirstossara gidana xamaqetidayti wurikka Kiristossa maydista. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Inte wurikka Yesusi Kiristossan isino attiin Ayhudene Girike aylene Goqqane maccane ade giza dumatethi dena. Inte wurikka Yesusi Kiristosan isi asho. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Inte Kirstossayta gidiko inte Abirame zerethata kasse imetida ufaysa qaala mala inte latanayta.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta gizay aawape yelettida nay aawa latay izas gidikokka izi bidi latana gakanas aylefe duma gidena. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Iza aaway izi diccidi giita gidana gakanas dichizade kushe gasan deyos. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nuka buro natethan diza wode hayssa 7alameza timirte mala ayletethan hareti deydos. Wogga garisara yeleti ba naza yeddides. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Gido attiin kasse ba qopii wothida wodey gakin Xoossi maccashayfe yelettidaysa Muse woggape garisara yeleti ba naza yeddides. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hesika nuni iza naa gidanamalane Muse wogga garisan dizayta wozana mala hanides. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Inte iza na gidida gish Xoossa “Nu aawa obo” gidi xaygiza ba naza ayana nu wozina gido yeddides. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hesa gish hayssafe guye ne nape attiin ayle gidaka. Nuni na gidida gish Xoossi nena bena latizade histides.</para>
  <para style="s">Gelatiya asas Phawulossa qohaaththaa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Inte Xoosu eranape kasse Xoosu gidonta eqatas aylista. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ha7i qasse Xoosu eridista hessafeka Xoossan eretidista. Histin qasseka guye simidi ede goy7ay baynda co daburisiza timrteka wanidi simizeti. Simidi qaseka ayletetha qamibaran waxistana koyeti? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Duma galasata aginata wodetane laythata bonchideti? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ta inte bolla daburidays co mela gidande gada babaysi <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ta ishato ta intena milatidamala inteka tana milatanamala ta intena wasays. Inte tana aykoka qohibeykista. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Inte erizamala ta intes koyro mishiracho qaala sabakiday sako gasona. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ta sakoy intes metto gidinka tana saletibeykista woykko tana harisebeykista gido attiin inte tana Xoossa kiitancha malane hessafeka bollara Yesuss Kiristos mala moki ekidista. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Histin hai he inte ufaysay awa gakiide? intes hanizaz gididako inte inte ayfe tas kees imanas inte guye gontaysa ta intes marikatays. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Tani tuma kesa yotida gish inte morike gidadinasha? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Heyti asati intena beko ekanas daburetes attiin loo7os daburetena. Isti koyzay intena nupe shakidi ba asa kesanas. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Loo7os mindatethi loo7oko hesika hananas besizay wuriso wode gidikofe attiin ta intenara diza wode xala gidena. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ta intena siqqiza ta nayto Kiristossay inte wozinan xafetin ta beyana gakanas inte gish ta miixatays. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ta inte gish qofan metotistadis. Ta dandaizako hai inte gidon bistada hanqo qalara intes yotizako aymala dosazina shin!</para>
  <para style="s">Agarone saro lemuseteth.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Omteno Muse wogga garisan aqana koyhayto ane tas yotite Muse woga ay gizakone siybeyketi? <verse number="22" style="v"/>Abirames isay aydeype asay qase godaiyfe yelettida nam7u nayti dizaysi kase xafetides. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ayleyfe yelettida nazi asho wogga mala yeletides hanko goqaype (Godateyfe) Yeletidaysa ufaysa qaala mala yeletides. <verse number="24" style="v"/>hayti naam7u macashati nam7u caqota besiza gish haysi lemusos imetides. Koyro caqoya sina zuma bolla gidashe ayletethas gidiza nayti yeliizaro izaka agaro guussa. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hesa gish agara arvbe biitan diza sino zuma giish gidada hai diza Yerusaleme milataysu iza ba nazara ayletethan daysu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Pude bolla bagara diza Yerussalamey gidiko goqqa Goda daysu izaka nu ayiyo <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Neni yelonta makaraye ufa7ista</para>
  <para style="q1">Hane miixata erontare</para>
  <para style="q2">Illil ga wassa</para>
  <para style="q1">Azinay dizarape balara</para>
  <para style="q2">Berka dizari nayti darida” geteti kasse xafetides.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hesa gish ta ishato inteka Ysaqamala ufaysa qaala naytako. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Asho shenemala kaseti yelettidaysi guyepe ayna woliqan yelettidaysa yedethides (godides) haiika godethan des. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Gido attiin maxxafay qasse ay gize? “Ayleyo izi nazaragathi diiga ayley nay goqaynara latina” ges. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hesa gish ta ishato nuni goqay nayti attiin ayley nayta gikoka.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nuna Kiristossay geshiday nuni geshatethan danas. Hessa gish miini eqite nam7antho ayletetha qanbaran ge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ta insa gizaysa wozina wothite inte qaxaristanakoyko Kistossay intes kiyontasa ta isas isas qoncen yotays. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Qaxaristanakoyzayti wuri Muse woga wursi polanaysi dosa gidenaysa ta intes isas isas qonccen yotays. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Inteno Muse wogan geyana (Xilana) waytizayto inte Kiristossape shaketidista iza kiyatethafeka hakidista. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nu qase ufaysan nagetiza xiilotetha ayana bagara amanon lamotethan nagon dosu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Asi Yesuss Kirstossan diko qaxaretin woykko qaxaretonta agin ayne go7ene go7ay dizay siqqon qoncciza amano xala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kase loo7o wothu woxista shin haii intes xuphe gididi tumasi inte azazetonta mala intena digiday oone? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hessa mala balethoy intena xeygidadefe yibeyna. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Gutha irshoy (calay) lixxe wuris callises. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Intes hara qofay dena gada tani Godan amanistaysi intes taki gizaz oothozay ona gidikone izi ba piirda ekana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ta ishato hachi gakanas tani qaxara gish sabakiizako oone tana godanay? Hesamala gididako masqalas shuphe gidenako shin. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Intes tii gizaz oothizaz oothiza asati co wogara qaxareteth agidi untafe dutheto. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ta ishato inte goqateth kezanas xeygetidista. Inteni inte goqateth zaridi untafe dutheto sho amo polanas go7etopite. Hessafe inte inte garisan siqqon isay isa madite. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Muse wogay wuri shiqetidi isi qalan qachetes hesika “Neni ne lage ne mala xeela gizaysa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Gido attiin inte isay isara saxxetizayta gidiko inte inte garisan wurontamala nagetite.</para>
  <para style="s">Ayanan simetetetha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessa gish ta intena ayanan simeretite gays asho amoka polopite. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ashoy ayanay koyontazi amotes ayanayka ashoy koyontaz amotes. Heyti isay isara ba garisan shocetiza (Ayetiza) gish inte inte koyda mala othekista. (hanekista) <verse number="18" style="v"/>Inte ayanan diza gidiko Muse woga garisan dekista.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Asho oothoy qonccen eretes hesika laymateth tunateth layma kasse (ziita) <verse number="20" style="v"/>Eqas goyno biita pola (adheteth) ooshu miqaneteth hanqo bena xala doso shaketeth zufeteth. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Qanateteth mathoteth 7lame yeth yexxethane heytanta milatizayta. Tani intes kaase yotida mala ha7ka inte nagistanamala qofisays. Hesamala dusu dizayti wurikka Xoossa kawotethi latetena.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ayana ayfey gidiko siiqo, ufays saroteth, danda7a, kiyateth, loo7oteth, amaneteth <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ashoketetha berka bena haro. Haytantamala digizay Muse wogga garisan dena.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesuss Kiristossas gididayti asho iza ita qofarane iza ita amotethara gathi kaqqida. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nu ayanan dana koyko ane ayanan simeretosu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ane nuni nu garisan isay isara mindi letizaysane qanatetishe mela hada ceeqetoko.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Asi wurisos loo7o ootho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ta ishato isi uray nagara oothi betiko inte qase ayanan loo7o dizayti iza ashaketethara zaranas beses gido attiin nekka izademala paccetonta mala ne hu7es nagista. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Isay isa dexxo toho toko hessamalan oothon Kirstossa wogga pollista. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Isadey ayne hanonta dishe ayko giitaso gakida milatiko he uray berika bena balethes. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Isi isi uray ba ootho berika pacci xelo. Hesafe guye hara urara bena ginasonta diisheizi bena ceqisizaz demana. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Isi isi uray berka ba toho tokanas beses. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Qala tamarizay onika ba tamarida loo7o misha ba astamarera gishetes. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Baletofite Xoosi qlicca erena. Assi ba zeridaro iza zera buccana. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Be asho amo kunthanas zerizadey ashope dhaysi buccana. Ayana ufaysanas zeridadey gidiko ayanape medhina deyo buccana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ane nu loo7o ootho oothanas azaloko nu ufaysi qanxonta agiko wodey gakishin nu gakida kaatha maxana. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hesa gish loo7o ootho oothanas azaloko nu ufaysi qanxxonta agiko wodey gakiishin nu gakiida kaatha maxana.</para>
  <para style="s">Ooratha medheteth gideth.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Tani ta kushera intes aymala gita piidalen xafidakone ane xeliite. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Co kare bagara bistana koyza asati inte qaxaristanamala gidesana koyetes. Isti hessa oothzay Kirstossa masqale gish gidi godetonta malako. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Isti inte qaxaristanamala koyzay inte ashon ceeqistanas koyza gish attiin qaxaretidayti Muse wogga nagizayta gidetena. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Qase 7alamey tas taka 7alames kaqetida Goda Yesuss Kiristossa masqalepe attiin hara ceqoy tape hakko. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Qaxaretin woykko qaxaretonta agin izas go7ay bawa. Go7ay medheteth. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Haysa ha azazoza kaalliza wurisosine Xoossa dere gidida Isra7elistas saroyne marotethi gido. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Tani Yesussa malata ta asatethan tokadis hessa gish hi7a tana oonikka waysena. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ta ishato Goda Yesus Kiristossa adho kiyatethi intenara godo. Amiini</para>
</usx>
